unty has 75 years on record, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids April to May came in under 90% of normal in 30 of them while January to February did in 37. In 2025 that middle ran 117% of normal in April to May and 56% in November to December. So far in 2026 it opened at 165% in January to February. Grid 22338 had its driest year in 1966 at 57%.</p>"}
